          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.monaco.com/v1/tasks/",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Creates a new task.\n\nTasks can be associated with an account (via `account_id`) and/or an opportunity (via `opportunity_id`). If no `assignee_id` is provided, the task is assigned to the caller."
